\\"$\\\",\\\"h3\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-medium text-gray-900 group-hover:text-blue-600 line-clamp-2 mb-2\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"2026년 최저임금 완벽 가이드: 시급, 월급 계산, 주휴수당까지 총정리\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm text-gray-500 line-clamp-2\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"2026년 최저임금이 확정되었습니다. 시급, 월급 환산액, 주휴수당 계산법, 사업주와 근로자가 알아야 할 핵심 내용을 총정리했습니다.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L6\\\",\\\"self-employed-tax-guide-2026\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/posts/self-employed-tax-guide-2026\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"group block p-4 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg hover:border-blue-500 transition-colors\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h3\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-medium text-gray-900 group-hover:text-blue-600 line-clamp-2 mb-2\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"개인사업자 절세 가이드 - 종합소득세, 부가세 완벽 정리\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm text-gray-500 line-clamp-2\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"개인사업자를 위한 2026년 절세 전략을 총정리했습니다. 종합소득세 신고, 부가가치세, 간이과세자 기준, 비용처리 방법까지 사업자가 꼭 알아야 할 세금 정보를 확인하세요.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L6\\\",\\\"real-estate-tax-guide-2026\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/posts/real-estate-tax-guide-2026\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"group block p-4 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg hover:border-blue-500 transition-colors\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h3\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-medium text-gray-900 group-hover:text-blue-600 line-clamp-2 mb-2\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"부동산 세금 총정리 - 취득세, 양도세, 종부세 완벽 가이드\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm text-gray-500 line-clamp-2\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"2026년 부동산 세금을 한눈에 정리했습니다. 취득세, 양도소득세, 종합부동산세의 세율과 계산 방법, 절세 전략까지 꼭 알아야 할 핵심 내용을 확인하세요.\\\"}]]}]]}]]}]\\n\"])</script></body></html>","rsc":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[1402,[\"619\",\"static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\",\"177\",\"static/chunks/app/layout-e78f5894d0a0b16c.js\"],\"\"]\n3:I[1398,[\"619\",\"static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\",\"177\",\"static/chunks/app/layout-e78f5894d0a0b16c.js\"],\"default\"]\n4:I[9